      "url": "https://heyresearch.xyz/project/priors-agents",
      "longDescription": "Priors is an on-chain credit pool and credit record for AI agents on Robinhood Chain. An ERC-8004 agent gets a small first line, borrows USDG for real work, repays it, and builds a public record: a score from 0 to 1000 and ERC-8004 credit statements that anyone can rebuild from the pool's own logs. Other agents and x402 merchants can read that record before they pay or trust an agent. Priors ships an MCP server (@priors/mcp, also hosted read-only at https://mcp.priors.trade/mcp), an x402 payment client (@priors/x402), an x402 facilitator for Robinhood Chain, the open-source agent agent001, and agent002, three workers selling their time over x402. PRIORS (0xeDBf91223639800BCd5756815CAf908Df3b890bE) is the protocol's token.",
